#: flowview_devices.php
msgid "There are two support collection methods, the first utilizes the legacy flow-tools binaries and the second leverages Cacti's own PHP based flow stream server."
msgstr "Waxaa jira laba hab oo taageerada ururinta ah, kan hore wuxuu adeegsadaa barnaamijyada duqowga ah ee flow-tools kan labaadna wuxuu ka faa'iidaystaa adeegaha qulqulka xogta ee ku salaysan PHP ee Cacti u gaarka ah."

#: flowview_devices.php
