#: flowview_filters.php
msgid "Materialization pre-computes the results of a Filter for each flow partition, with NAT on and off, and stores them in the Parallel Query cache, so reports over older data open quickly.  New partitions are materialized automatically once they stop receiving flows.  Required means partitions that have rotated are not materialized yet, Running means a materialization is in progress, and Up to date means every rotated partition is materialized.  Running: N is how many queries of the Filter are working now.  The partition still receiving flows is not materialized, so it does not count."
msgstr "Dhabayntu waxay horudhac u xisaabisaa natiijooyinka Shaandheeye ee qayb kasta oo qulqul ah, iyadoo NAT uu shidan yahay iyo isagoo dansan, waxayna ku kaydisaa kaydka ku-meel-gaarka ah ee Weydiimaha Isbarbar-socda, si warbixinnada xogta duugga ah ay si dhakhso leh ugu furmaan.  Qaybaha cusub si otomaatig ah ayaa loo dhabeyaa marka ay joojiyaan helitaanka qulqulka.  Loo baahan yahay waxay ka dhigan tahay qaybaha wareegay weli lama dhabayn, Socda waxay ka dhigan tahay dhabayn ayaa socota, La cusboonaysiiyay waxayna ka dhigan tahay qayb kasta oo wareegtay waa la dhabeyay.  Socda: N waa inta weydiimo ee Shaandheeyaha ah ee hadda shaqaynaya.  Qaybta weli heleysa qulqulka lama dhabeyo, sidaas darteed lama tiriyo."

