#: setup.php
msgid "Many Big Tech data collection services like to mask their ownership of domains to obfuscate the fact that they are collecting your personal information.  If you are concerned with this and your Cacti install has access to the Internet, you can use Arin to remove the mask from those Big Tech companies."
msgstr "Adeegyo badan oo ururinta xogta ah ee shirkadaha waaweyn ee tiknoolajiyadda (Big Tech) waxay jecel yihiin inay qariyaan lahaanshaha domain-nadooda si ay u qariyaan xaqiiqada ah inay ururinayaan macluumaadkaaga shakhsiyeed.  Haddii aad ka walwalsan tahay arrintan oo rakibiddaada Cacti ay leedahay gelitaan Internet, waxaad isticmaali kartaa Arin si aad uga saarto daboolka shirkadahaas waaweyn ee tiknoolajiyadda."

