#: setup.php
msgid "Parallel Queries"
msgstr "Weydiimaha Isbarbar-socda"

#: setup.php
msgid "Parallel Query Backend"
msgstr "Nidaamka Dambe ee Weydiinta Isbarbar-socda"

#: setup.php
msgid "Choose how parallel FlowView queries are executed.  The Legacy PHP Runner forks the flowview_runner.php process per query and shard.  The FlowView Query Service dispatches the same map-reduce work to a long-running Go service over localhost, avoiding per-query process startup and database polling latency.  Requires the flowview-query service (see plugins/flowview/service/flowview-query) to be installed and running."
msgstr "Dooro sida weydiimaha FlowView ee isbarbar socda loo fuliyo.  Orodka PHP ee Hore wuxuu fargameeyaa habka flowview_runner.php weydiin kasta iyo qayb kasta.  Adeegga Weydiinta FlowView wuxuu u diraa isla shaqada map-reduce adeeg Go ah oo muddo dheer socda iyada oo loo marayo localhost, taas oo ka fogaanaysa bilaabidda habka weydiin kasta iyo daahitaanka xog-uruurinta xog-kaydka.  Waxay u baahan tahay in adeegga flowview-query (eeg plugins/flowview/service/flowview-query) la rakibo oo uu shaqaynayo."

#: setup.php
msgid "Legacy PHP Runner"
msgstr "Socodsiiyaha PHP ee Hore"

#: setup.php
msgid "FlowView Query Service"
msgstr "Adeegga Waydiinta FlowView"

#: setup.php
msgid "Query Service URL"
msgstr "URL-ka Adeegga Weydiinta"

#: setup.php
msgid "Base URL of the FlowView Query Service, for example http://127.0.0.1:8699.  Leave blank to auto-discover the ephemeral port from the service's port file."
msgstr "URL-ka aasaasiga ah ee Adeegga Weydiinta FlowView, tusaale ahaan http://127.0.0.1:8699.  Bannaan u daa si aad si toos ah ugu hesho dekadda ku-meel-gaarka ah faylka dekadda ee adeegga."

#: setup.php
msgid "Query Service Port File"
msgstr "Faylka Dekedda Adeegga Weydiinta"

#: setup.php
msgid "Path to the port file the FlowView Query Service writes its bound address to.  Used to discover the service endpoint when the Query Service URL above is blank."
msgstr "Jidka faylka dekedda ee Adeegga Weydiinta FlowView uu ku qoro ciwaanka uu ku xiran yahay. Waxaa loo isticmaalaa in lagu ogaado barta dhammaadka adeegga marka URL-ka Adeegga Weydiinta ee sare uu bannaan yahay."

#: setup.php
msgid "Query Service Token"
msgstr "Calaamadda Adeegga Weydiinta"

#: setup.php
msgid "Optional shared secret.  When set, Cacti sends it to the FlowView Query Service as an \"Authorization: Bearer\" header and the service rejects any state-changing request that does not present the same token.  Set the matching value in the service's config file (auth_token) or the FLOWVIEW_QUERY_TOKEN environment variable.  Recommended whenever the service is reachable by anything other than trusted local processes."
msgstr "Sir la wadaago oo ikhtiyaari ah. Marka la dejiyo, Cacti wuxuu u diraa Adeegga Weydiinta FlowView sidii madax \"Authorization: Bearer\" ah adeegguna wuxuu diidaa codsi kasta oo xaalad-beddel ah oo aan soo bandhigin isla calaamaddaas (token). Ku deji qiimaha u dhigma faylka habaynta adeegga (auth_token) ama doorsoomaha deegaanka FLOWVIEW_QUERY_TOKEN. Waxaa lagula talinayaa mar kasta oo adeegga ay gaari karaan wax aan ahayn hababka maxalliga ah ee la aamini karo."

#: setup.php
msgid "Max Concurrent Threads"
msgstr "Dunaha Isku Mar Shaqeeya ee Ugu Badan"

#: setup.php
msgid "The maximum number of threads that will be dispatched to run the FlowView queries.  Note that you can have at most 1 thread per database partition, and you should be careful not to overload your database server with having too many concurrent threads running."
msgstr "Tirada ugu badan ee dunta (threads) ee la diri doono si ay u socodsiiyaan weydiimaha FlowView.  Ogsoonow inaad yeelan karto ugu badnaan 1 dun qayb kasta oo kaydka xogta ah, waana inaad ka taxaddartaa inaadan culeys xad-dhaaf ah saarin adeegahaaga kaydka xogta adigoo socodsiinaya dunta isku mar ah oo aad u badan."

